{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01592","headline":"琴曲歌辞 宛转行 · 张籍","name":"琴曲歌辞 宛转行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华屋重翠幄，绮席雕象牀。\n远漏微更疎，薄衾中夜凉。\n炉氲暗裴回，寒灯背斜光。\n妍姿结宵态，寝臂幽梦长。\n宛转复宛转，忆忆更未央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}